#  Coverage:
#    - Nominal: TT inclusive + SemiLeptonic + 2L2Nu (dilepton)
#    - Systematics: hdamp, mtop, tune, isr/fsr, color reconnection (CR), erdON
#    - Era: UL2017 (NanoAODv9). Add other years by duplicating with suffix.
#  -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

